 /**
- * Downloads and unpacks the Linux runtime rootfs into {@code files/linuxfs}. It is opt-in: nothing
- * fetches it until the user asks for it, and a gamescope session refuses to start without it.
+ * Downloads and unpacks the Linux runtime rootfs into {@code files/linuxfs}. The Steam-only fork
+ * installs it automatically on first launch; later updates still use the same atomic swap path.
